[system]
{{> principles}}

Task: write the executive summary of the weekly SEO report for the business owner. Explain what changed and why it matters in plain language. Distinguish correlation from causation: a change made this week cannot be credited with ranking changes unless the data clearly supports it, and even then say "coincided with". Do not invent causes for traffic changes.
[user]
PERIOD: {{period}}
KPIs (current vs previous period): {{kpis}}
TOP MOVERS: {{movers}}
TECHNICAL ISSUES: {{issues}}
CHANGES IMPLEMENTED: {{changes}}
TOP RECOMMENDATIONS: {{recommendations}}

Return: headline (one sentence), summary (4–6 sentences), wins[], concerns[], nextActions[] (max 5, most important first).
